stream
BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Parental Leave Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-HR-031 | Owner: People Team | Effective date: 1 April 2023 | Version: 1) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 676 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 654 Td (Meridian Instruments wants employees to be able to spend time with their families when a child) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (arrives. This policy sets a global minimum standard of company-enhanced parental pay, which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (applies on top of the statutory leave and pay rights in each country where we operate.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 603 Td (2. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 581 Td (The policy covers birth parents, primary adopters, surrogate parents who are the child's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 568 Td (intended primary carer, and partners \(including the other adoptive parent\). It applies to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 555 Td (employees in the UK, the Netherlands, the United States and Malaysia.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 533 Td (Where local law gives a better entitlement than this policy, the local law applies. Where this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 520 Td (policy is more generous, the company enhancement applies.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 495 Td (3. Eligibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 473 Td (To receive company-enhanced pay, an employee must have at least 26 weeks of continuous service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 460 Td (with Meridian at the 15th week before the expected week of childbirth, or at the week the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 447 Td (adopter is notified of being matched with a child. Employees who do not meet the service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 434 Td (requirement still receive their full statutory leave and pay.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 409 Td (4. Birth parent and primary adopter leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (Eligible birth parents and primary adopters receive 16 weeks at full pay. After the enhanced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (period, the remainder of any statutory leave is paid at the statutory rate for the country, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361 Td (any further unpaid statutory leave may be taken.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 340 Td (Country | Statutory leave \(summary\) | Company enhancement) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 328 Td (UK | up to 52 weeks | 16 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 316 Td (Netherlands | 16 weeks pregnancy and maternity leave | 16 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 304 Td (United States | up to 12 weeks unpaid \(FMLA\) | 16 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 292 Td (Malaysia | 98 days maternity leave | 16 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 270 Td (Company pay is paid through normal payroll. Any statutory pay the employee receives, such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 257 Td (Statutory Maternity Pay in the UK or the UWV benefit in the Netherlands, is offset against) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 244 Td (company pay, so the employee receives no more than full pay in total.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 219 Td (5. Partner leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 197 Td (Eligible partners receive 2 weeks of partner leave at full pay. The leave must be taken in one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 184 Td (block or two separate weeks within 8 weeks of the birth or placement. Statutory partner leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 171 Td (beyond this is paid at the statutory rate where one applies.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 146 Td (6. Adoption and surrogacy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 124 Td (Primary adopters and intended primary carers through surrogacy receive the same entitlement as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 111 Td (birth parents. Reasonable paid time off is given to attend adoption meetings and up to five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 98 Td (antenatal appointments for the intended parents.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 73 Td (7. Notification) Tj ET
endstream
