6 0 obj
<< /Length 2709 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (Employees must notify their manager and the People Team using the Parental Leave Notification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (\(F-301\) at least 15 weeks before the expected week of childbirth, or within 7 days of being) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (matched for adoption. The form records the expected date, intended start of leave and any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (partner leave dates. Leave dates can be changed with 28 days' notice.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 665 Td (8. During leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (Contractual benefits other than salary continue during enhanced paid leave. Annual leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 630 Td (continues to accrue under the regional leave policy for your country. Employees may work up to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 617 Td (10 keeping-in-touch days by agreement with their manager, paid at their normal daily rate,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (without ending their leave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 582 Td (Pension contributions continue during the enhanced paid period on the basis of full pay. During) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 569 Td (any statutory-paid or unpaid period, employer contributions follow the rules for your country's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (pension arrangement. Life cover and medical insurance continue throughout the whole period of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 543 Td (leave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (Managers should agree with the employee before leave starts how much contact they would like) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 508 Td (during leave, and should make sure the employee continues to receive important announcements,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 495 Td (such as changes to their team, restructures and internal vacancies.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 470 Td (9. Returning to work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 448 Td (Employees returning from birth parent or primary adopter leave may take a phased return of 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 435 Td (weeks working 80% of their normal hours on full pay. The pattern is agreed with the line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (manager before the return date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 400 Td (Employees who wish to change their working pattern permanently after leave can submit a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (Flexible Working Request \(F-315\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 362 Td (10. Repayment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 340 Td (Company-enhanced pay is not subject to repayment if the employee does not return to work.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 315 Td (11. Contacts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 293 Td (Questions about this policy can be raised with peoplehelp@meridian-instruments.example. Payroll) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 280 Td (questions about statutory pay offsets should go to the payroll team for your country.) Tj ET
endstream
